            "enabled": true,
            "id": 1297,
            "kind": "Script",
            "name": "Animate",
            "pos": [
              0.0,
              0.0,
              0.0
            ],
            "rot": [
              0.0,
              0.0,
              0.0
            ],
            "size": [
              1.0,
              1.0,
              1.0
            ],
            "source": "-- Animate: your character's animations, the classic (2011) way.\n-- The engine plays them for you: idle, walk, run, jump, fall, climb, sit,\n-- toolnone (holding a tool), swim, and the emotes dance, dance2, dance3,\n-- laugh, cheer, wave and point (say \"/e dance\" in chat, or call\n-- humanoid:PlayEmote(\"dance\") from a script).\n--\n-- Make your own: open one of the values in here (walk, idle...), give the\n-- Animation inside it some keyframes in the Animation Editor, and your\n-- character plays that instead of the classic one.\n-- Turn this script off (Enabled) to stop the automatic animations.\n"
          }
        ],
